      "id": "smart-government-applications-powered-by-digital-wallets-HCB5DD",
      "sector": "public_sector",
      "title": "Smart Government Applications Powered by Digital Wallets",
      "summary": "Our award-winning platform demonstrates how digital wallets and AI guidance can transform government-to-business (G2B) services in the Netherlands—today. \n\nDesigned with real public issuers and relying parties, it streamlines complex processes through reusable, modular components, and a Key Life-Event approach (e.g., entrepreneurs obtaining government funding). The benefits for entrepreneurs are multiple: ease and speed in finding and applying for government services; easily share data, just once; and keeping control of own data. Government gains: efficiency from complete and compliant applications; scalability across domains (due to the modular and wallet-agnostic design); and traceability and reliability of interactions.  \n\nBorn from a 2025 public-private hackathon and now backed by the Digital Government Innovation Budget (2026), the platform replaces fragmentation with a unified, future-proof solution.",
