      "userJourney": "See the full user flow in our demo video:demo video: https://youtu.be/nYZhjH3czps.\n\nThe platform integrates seamlessly with existing processes, offering a smooth transition for users and government alike.\n1.\tStart at a familiar place\nUsers begin on a trusted government website (e.g., RVO’s subsidy portal), where they find a clear “Go to app” button.\n\n2.\tFind the right subsidy – fast\nOn the app’s orientation page, users choose how to explore:\nAI search: Get tailored recommendations via chat.\nManual search: Browse subsidies directly.\nAI chatbot: Ask questions in real time.\n\n3.\tAI guides the way\nThe chatbot asks simple questions to identify the best funding matches. No repetitive data entry—user details are securely stored in their profile.\n\n4.\tInstant match results\nFunding is color-coded by relevance:\nGreen: Great fit.\nYellow: Partial match.\nGrey: Bad fit.\n\n5.\tApply with confidence\nSelect a subsidy → click “Apply.”\nLog in securely with a personal wallet (no passwords).\nBusiness details and evidence are easily shared via the business wallet.\n\n6.\tAI-assisted completion\nThe AI walks users through the application step-by-step, ensuring accuracy and compliance—without overwhelming them.",
      "country": "NL"
